  ChangeTimeOfAction: -2
  Text: 'Her pockets are empty; she carries no possessions with her whatsoever. Who
    travels like that?


    Whatever happened to her sent her into a deep, shell-shocked
    state.


    She just repeats "there are two at 54" over and over.


    I don''t
    think she knows we even exist at the moment.'
  TextForRepetition: 'We already did that, remember?

    The report is probably
    on your desk or in the DB if you uploaded it.'
